# Excludes paths from the Docker build context.
#
# The context is the REPOSITORY ROOT (not server/) because the dashboard
# was moved out to /dashboard while server/Dockerfile still bundles it in
# a node stage (issue #44). See server/docker-compose.yaml `build:`.
#
# Strategy: whitelist — deny everything, re-admit the two trees and the
# server image needs, then drop the heavy / generated / secret bits back
# out. Adding a new top-level dir therefore does NOT silently bloat the
# context. Build identity inputs are re-admitted explicitly below. Note
# `.git` stays excluded (nothing in the build reads it).
#
# https://docs.docker.com/engine/reference/builder/#dockerignore-file
*
!server/
!dashboard/
!VERSION
!scripts/
!scripts/build-identity.mjs

# Node deps (dashboard/node_modules must be rebuilt inside the image so
# the lockfile install stays the single source of truth).
**/node_modules/

# Mix artifacts — fetched and compiled inside the image.
server/_build/
server/deps/
*.ez

# Development/test artifacts
server/cover/
server/doc/
server/test/
server/tmp/
server/.elixir_ls/

# Generated on crash by the VM
erl_crash.dump

# Dashboard build output — produced by the node stage, never copied in
# (https://hexdocs.pm/phoenix/Mix.Tasks.Phx.Gen.Release.html#module-docker).
server/priv/static/assets/
server/priv/static/cache_manifest.json
server/priv/static/index.html

# Legacy persona extraction cache (moved out of the persona dir by
# ADR-0046; kept so pre-move leftovers cannot enter the build context)
server/priv/persona-packs/.cache/

# Local env files (secrets) must never enter the build context
server/.env
server/.env.*
!server/.env.example
